(7432388, 1174368, 150277, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  In my top two for the challenge.  I love the smoothness and that gold band amidst all the blue added interest to me.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  In my top two for the challenge.  I love the smoothness and that gold band amidst all the blue added interest to me.', '2016-01-27 13:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432389, 1174364, 150277, '<td valign="top">This was in my top two.  Very abstract and I love the b&amp;w.</td>', 'This was in my top two.  Very abstract and I love the b&w.', '2016-01-27 13:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432390, 1174387, 150277, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful.  Just a suggestion of a scene...</td>', 'Really beautiful.  Just a suggestion of a scene...', '2016-01-27 13:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432391, 1174343, 150277, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  It felt to me like a gigantic crater surrounded by mountains.  I wonder if it might really be a much smaller scene, but I honestly can''t figure it out so I keep looking and looking.</td>', 'I really like this.  It felt to me like a gigantic crater surrounded by mountains.  I wonder if it might really be a much smaller scene, but I honestly can''t figure it out so I keep looking and looking.', '2016-01-27 13:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432392, 1174342, 150277, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and movement.  I like the deep blue so deep into the scene, enhanced the abstractness to me.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and movement.  I like the deep blue so deep into the scene, enhanced the abstractness to me.', '2016-01-27 13:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432393, 1174396, 150277, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Love the minimalist feel I get from this image. B&amp;W a perfect fit.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Love the minimalist feel I get from this image. B&W a perfect fit.', '2016-01-27 14:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432394, 1174390, 150277, '<td valign="top">Lovely and subtle, love it.</td>', 'Lovely and subtle, love it.', '2016-01-27 14:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432396, 1174397, 150277, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Feels strong and bright and sunny.  The colors lend well to landscapes and there is a definite abstractness, wonderful abstractness, total abstractness.  Maybe the most abstract of the image in the challenge.</td>', 'I like this.  Feels strong and bright and sunny.  The colors lend well to landscapes and there is a definite abstractness, wonderful abstractness, total abstractness.  Maybe the most abstract of the image in the challenge.', '2016-01-27 14:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432401, 1174456, 150277, '<td valign="top">So silky smooth.  Such delicate colors.  Wonderful for the eyes.</td>', 'So silky smooth.  Such delicate colors.  Wonderful for the eyes.', '2016-01-27 14:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432403, 1174132, 150277, '<td valign="top">Such softness and sereneness in color then such sharpness in lines.  I love the abstractness of this.  There is an unsettled feeling I am left with after spending a few minutes looking.</td>', 'Such softness and sereneness in color then such sharpness in lines.  I love the abstractness of this.  There is an unsettled feeling I am left with after spending a few minutes looking.', '2016-01-27 14:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432407, 1174409, 150277, '<td valign="top">My imagination can discern a scene from this lovely hint of a winter scene.</td>', 'My imagination can discern a scene from this lovely hint of a winter scene.', '2016-01-27 14:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432426, 1174391, 150277, '<td valign="top">I love the vibrancy of the blue color and its abstractness works fairly well for me.  The longer I look the more I like this.  The blue on the left leads my eye of the picture a little.</td>', 'I love the vibrancy of the blue color and its abstractness works fairly well for me.  The longer I look the more I like this.  The blue on the left leads my eye of the picture a little.', '2016-01-27 16:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432435, 1174098, 33068, '<td valign="top">Lydia?</td>', 'Lydia?', '2016-01-27 17:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432471, 1174101, 150277, '<td valign="top">As an image, I love this.  For meeting the challenge as an abstract landscape, to me the image didn''t score as highly with that.  I found the image very artsy but just not terribly abstract.  I do however love the color and the bit of murkiness and obscurity in the lower part of the image.  Maybe I am being too stringent with my idea of an abstract?  (My love is for abstracts such as Kandinsky.  So way out there abstract is where i tend to think of abstracts.  Possibly not a fair comparison.).   I would hang this on my wall.</td>', 'As an image, I love this.  For meeting the challenge as an abstract landscape, to me the image didn''t score as highly with that.  I found the image very artsy but just not terribly abstract.  I do however love the color and the bit of murkiness and obscurity in the lower part of the image.  Maybe I am being too stringent with my idea of an abstract?  (My love is for abstracts such as Kandinsky.  So way out there abstract is where i tend to think of abstracts.  Possibly not a fair comparison.).   I would hang this on my wall.', '2016-01-27 19:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432487, 1174096, 150277, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  I do not find it terribly abstract.  But so lovely.  Feels like a Christmas card.</td>', 'Lovely.  I do not find it terribly abstract.  But so lovely.  Feels like a Christmas card.', '2016-01-27 20:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
