(7433818, 1174379, 37858, '<td valign="top">Yeah.  I was inspired by Sisto''s ninth place photo in the World Enough and Time challenge, but didn''t stop to notice that Sisto''s shot was in an expert challenge, while the current challenge is not.  Duh.  Oh well...  At any rate, it was fun to make, so not all was lost by the DQ.</td>', 'Yeah.  I was inspired by Sisto''s ninth place photo in the World Enough and Time challenge, but didn''t stop to notice that Sisto''s shot was in an expert challenge, while the current challenge is not.  Duh.  Oh well...  At any rate, it was fun to make, so not all was lost by the DQ.', '2016-02-01 04:13:14.000000', NULL, 0),
