(7434582, 1174427, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the HM. Very nice, and I know it isn''t easy to get the effect you want. You did a great job. Btw, I put an outtake in the Outtakes  which is a bit similar to your entry, but arrived at differently.</td>', 'Congratulations on the HM. Very nice, and I know it isn''t easy to get the effect you want. You did a great job. Btw, I put an outtake in the Outtakes  which is a bit similar to your entry, but arrived at differently.', '2016-02-04 04:55:02.000000', NULL, 0),
